CO2 estimates use the emission factors of claude-carbon (MIT, Gaetan Wittebolle),
github.com/gwittebolle/claude-carbon, data/factors.json read 2026-10-22: grams CO2e per million
tokens per model family, after Jegham et al. 2025 (arXiv 2505.09598), cache reads at 0.08 of input,
grid 0.287 kgCO2e/kWh. Ported as crates/co2-data/src/jegham.json, keyed by model id (the "Jegham" CO2
method).
tokenwhy also reads its sessions-history.tsv, when present, for days older than its own history.
No code, network code or presentation is copied.

